def capital():
    return intro('CAPITAL & STRATEGIC PARTNERS','Partnership built around <em>real assets.</em>','Plexus welcomes conversations with organizations seeking a disciplined, project-specific approach to development and real estate.')+f'''<section class="section wrap split-copy"><div>{eyebrow('INVESTMENT APPROACH')}<h2>Alignment begins with a clear project thesis.</h2></div><div><p>Each potential partnership starts with the asset, the development path and the risks that need to be understood. Plexus’s focus spans housing, commercial and strategic land opportunities in Nova Scotia, with Atlantic Canada as a wider area of interest.</p><p>Scope, role, governance, reporting and capital terms belong in private, project-specific discussions supported by diligence.</p>{link('Explore selected projects','/portfolio/')}</div></section><section class="section-dark section"><div class="wrap">{section_head('HOW WE THINK','Disciplined by design.')}<div class="three-columns"><article><span>01</span><h3>Development logic</h3><p>Connect site potential to an achievable program and delivery path.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Risk awareness</h3><p>Assess planning, costs, timing, counterparties and operational needs.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Partner alignment</h3><p>Define responsibilities, information flow and decision points for each relationship.</p></article></div><p class="legal-inline">This page is general company information. It is not an offer to sell securities or a promise of investment returns.</p></div></section><section class="section wrap centered">{eyebrow('DISCUSS A PARTNERSHIP')}<h2>Start a private conversation.</h2>{link('Contact Plexus','/contact/?topic=capital','gold')}</section>'''

